data: {"id": "15975ad01b6d4c49-thinking-parallel_evidence-735", "run_id": "15975ad01b6d4c49", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与冲突\n\n**支持 `PendingUnschedulable` 的证据：**\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`phase=Pending`，`nodeName=none`，`PodScheduled=False` — 确认 Pod 始终未调度。\n2. **调度事件**：`FailedScheduling` 事件反复出现（17m 前及 7m24s 前），完整原因：`\"3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"`。\n3. **YAML 中的调度约束**：`nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}` — Pod 要求节点上有 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 标签。\n4. **集群节点状态**：3 个节点（master、node1、node2）全部为 `Ready` 状态，但它们的标签中均**不含** `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`。节点仅具有标准的 `kubernetes.io/*`、`metax-tech.", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788404541849, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

