data: {"id": "15975ad01b6d4c49-final", "run_id": "15975ad01b6d4c49", "seq": 1479, "ts_ms": 1788404569778, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` | Pending | Pod配置了nodeSelector 'aiops.lab/unavailable=true'，但集群中全部3个节点均未设置该标签，导致调度器无法找到匹配节点（FailedScheduling）。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedScheduling`: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector. | 直接证明调度器因节点不匹配无法调度 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.condition(PodScheduled)`: False, reason: Unschedulable | 确认 Pod 长期处于不可调度状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase` / `pod.status`: Pending | 确认 Pod 尚未进入运行阶段 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `resource_limit.memory`: 32Mi; `resource_limit.cpu`: 50m; `resource_request.memory`: 8Mi; `resource_request.cpu`: 5m | 提供资源上下文，证明非资源不足导致的调度失败 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase(Pending)`: 1 | 监控层面确认 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态 |\n\n证据间互相印证：K8s Event 指出 3 个节点均不匹配 NodeSelector 标签，这是导致 `PodScheduled=False` 和 `Pending` 状态的直接原因；Metric 数据在监控维度上确认了这一长期状态，而资源配置（Fact 4）显示资源极小且非限制因素，排除了资源不足的可能性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置 nodeSelector 'aiops.lab/unavailable=true' → 集群 3 个节点均无此标签 → 调度器返回 FailedScheduling (0/3 nodes match) → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **节点标签选择器不匹配**。\n集群中所有节点均未设置标签 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`，导致调度器无法将 Pod `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` 分配到任何节点（证据 1, 2）。\n\n当前证据不足以判断该配置的意图：\n- 是否属于配置错误（误填了禁止调度的标签）；\n- 还是业务确实需要部署到具有该特定标签的节点（需确认集群中是否有带该标签的节点被隔离或未纳入查询范围）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh: 41.5s (Evidence 34.6s, RCA 6.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 69.584, "metrics": {"run_id": "15975ad01b6d4c49", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 69.58902478218079, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 69589.02478218079, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 65055.43303489685, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 10270.650386810303, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4058.02321434021}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 20147.523641586304, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 41502.94876098633, "success":